### ============================================
### Movie Ticket Booking System - API Testing
### Industry-Standard Booking Flow
### ============================================
### This file follows enterprise-grade movie ticket booking flow:
### 1. Browse & Discovery
### 2. Seat Selection & Booking Creation
### 3. Payment Processing
### 4. Confirmation & Ticket Generation
### 5. Booking Management (View, Cancel)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@apiUrl = {{baseUrl}}/api

### ============================================
### VARIABLES - Fill these after running Setup Phase
### ============================================
@user_id = d15c151f-b4c0-444f-a684-55b85fafbb61
@movie_id = 8a0c9498-45f8-47c2-956b-141be9a27684
@showtime_id = c32709a2-9e70-481b-9c4c-34f884d7ce47
@seat_id1 = 10b0712b-696f-4b8d-975c-98337b018f34
@seat_id2 = 2f8e45fc-3fc9-49e3-b836-ae4c190096c3

# @theater_id = 
# @screen_id = 

@booking_id = fbfaf797-3511-4bab-813c-c1b51d097a17

@payment_id = 27dffc31-3913-4f6c-ac28-57d2a68e0254

### ============================================
### PHASE 0: SETUP & DISCOVERY
### ============================================
### Step 0.1: Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Step 0.2: Get API Information
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Step 0.3: Create or Get User
### Option A: Create new user (copy "id" from response → paste in @user_id)
POST {{apiUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "User2",
  "email": "user2@example.com"
}

### Option B: Get existing users (copy any "id" → paste in @user_id)
GET {{apiUrl}}/users

### Step 0.4: Browse Movies
### Get all movies with optional filtering
GET {{apiUrl}}/movies

### Step 0.5: Search Movies (with filters)
GET {{apiUrl}}/movies/search?title=You Belong to Me sushi&genre=Horror&language=English

### Step 0.6: Get Movie Details
GET {{apiUrl}}/movies/{{movie_id}}

### Step 0.7: Get Showtimes for Movie
GET {{apiUrl}}/showtimes/movie/{{movie_id}}

### Step 0.8: Get All Showtimes (with pagination)
GET {{apiUrl}}/showtimes?limit=10&offset=0

### Step 0.9: Get Showtime Details
GET {{apiUrl}}/showtimes/{{showtime_id}}

### Step 0.10: Get Available Seats for Showtime
### IMPORTANT: Copy seat IDs from available seats → paste in @seat_id1, @seat_id2
GET {{apiUrl}}/showtimes/{{showtime_id}}/seats

### ============================================
### PHASE 2: BOOKING CREATION
### ============================================
### Industry Standard: Create booking with selected seats
### Booking status: "pending" (awaiting payment)
### 
### Step 2.1: Create Booking
POST {{apiUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "{{user_id}}",
  "showtime_id": "{{showtime_id}}",
  "seat_ids": ["{{seat_id1}}", "{{seat_id2}}"]
}


### Step 2.2: Verify Booking Created
GET {{apiUrl}}/bookings/{{booking_id}}
### Expected: status = "pending", includes seat details and total_amount

### ============================================
### PHASE 3: PAYMENT PROCESSING
### ============================================

### Step 3.1: Process Payment
### IMPORTANT: Replace amount with actual total_amount from booking response
POST {{apiUrl}}/payments/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "booking_id": "{{booking_id}}",
  "payment_method": "eSewa",
  "amount": 29.98,
  "idempotency_key": "payment-{{booking_id}}-{{$timestamp}}"
}


### Step 3.2: Verify Payment Status
GET {{apiUrl}}/payments/{{payment_id}}
### Expected: payment details with status

### Step 3.3: Get Payment by Booking ID (includes receipt if successful)
GET {{apiUrl}}/payments/booking/{{booking_id}}
### Expected: payment details + receipt (if payment successful)

### ============================================
### PHASE 4: BOOKING CONFIRMATION & TICKET
### ============================================

### Step 4.1: Verify Booking is Confirmed
GET {{apiUrl}}/bookings/{{booking_id}}
### Expected: status = "confirmed", confirmed_at timestamp present

### Step 4.2: Get Booking Receipt/Ticket
### Receipt is included in payment response, or can be retrieved via booking
GET {{apiUrl}}/payments/booking/{{booking_id}}

### ============================================
### PHASE 5: BOOKING MANAGEMENT
### ============================================
### Step 5.1: Get All Bookings for User
GET {{apiUrl}}/bookings/user/{{user_id}}
### Expected: Array of all bookings for the user

### Step 5.2: Get All Bookings (Admin View)
GET {{apiUrl}}/bookings
### Expected: Array of all bookings in system

### Step 5.3: Verify Seats are Booked (no longer available)
GET {{apiUrl}}/showtimes/{{showtime_id}}/seats
### Expected: Reserved seats show as "booked" or "reserved"

### ============================================
### PHASE 6: BOOKING CANCELLATION
### ============================================
### Step 6.1: Cancel Booking (Recommended Method - PUT)
PUT {{apiUrl}}/bookings/{{booking_id}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{}
### Step 6.2: Verify Cancellation
GET {{apiUrl}}/bookings/{{booking_id}}
### Expected: status = "cancelled"

### Step 6.3: Verify Seats are Restored (available again)
GET {{apiUrl}}/showtimes/{{showtime_id}}/seats
### Expected: Previously booked seats now show as "available"

### Step 6.4: Verify Payment Refund Status
GET {{apiUrl}}/payments/refund?booking_id={{booking_id}}
### Expected: payment.status = "refunded" (if payment existed)


### ============================================
### PHASE 7: ADVANCED BOOKING OPERATIONS
### ============================================
### Step 7.1: Update Booking Status (with state transition validation)
PUT {{apiUrl}}/bookings/{{booking_id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "reserved"
}

### Step 7.2: Manual Booking Confirmation (if payment processed separately)
POST {{apiUrl}}/bookings/confirm/{{booking_id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payment_id": "{{payment_id}}"
}
### Expected: Booking confirmed manually
### Note: Usually not needed as payment processing auto-confirms



